# Investigative Question

One of the most important questions in blockchain investigations is:

**How does an investigator move from a wallet address to attribution of a threat actor?**

The Ronin investigation demonstrates that attribution rarely comes from a single transaction.

Instead, investigators reportedly combined multiple sources of evidence to build a broader intelligence picture.

